{"type":"standard","title":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Georgia","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Georgia</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q132132566","titles":{"canonical":"2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Georgia","normalized":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Georgia","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Georgia</span></span>"},"pageid":78936414,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Seal_of_Georgia.svg/330px-Seal_of_Georgia.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":330},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Seal_of_Georgia.svg/330px-Seal_of_Georgia.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":297,"height":297},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1382280355","tid":"6c2dafaf-d23c-11f1-831c-3b21c41344a7","timestamp":"2026-10-27T19:27:18Z","description":"","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Georgia","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Georgia?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Georgia?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Georgia"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Georgia","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Georgia","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Georgia?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Georgia"}},"extract":"The 2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Georgia will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the 14 U.S. representatives from the state of Georgia. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. Primary elections took place on May 19, 2026, and in races where no candidate received over 50% in a primary, runoff elections were held on June 16.","extract_html":"<p>The <b>2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Georgia</b> will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the 14 U.S. representatives from the state of Georgia. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. Primary elections took place on May 19, 2026, and in races where no candidate received over 50% in a primary, runoff elections were held on June 16.</p>"}